## 1. Core modules

### 👥 Employee Management

* Employee registration
* Employee ID
* Department
* Designation
* Branch/location
* Joining date
* Manager/reporting manager
* Employment type
* Employee documents
* Employee profile
* Active/inactive employees

### 🕐 Attendance Management ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐

* Check-in / Check-out
* Web attendance
* Mobile attendance
* GPS attendance
* Geofencing
* Selfie/photo attendance
* IP-based attendance
* Device-based attendance
* Multiple punches
* Late arrival
* Early departure
* Half-day
* Full-day
* Overtime
* Break management
* Attendance regularization
* Attendance correction
* Attendance lock/freeze

### 📅 Shift Management

Support:

```text
Fixed Shift
Flexible Shift
Rotational Shift
Night Shift
Split Shift
Overnight Shift
```

Example:

```text
09:30 AM ───────── 06:30 PM
       ↓
    9 Hours
```

### 🏖️ Leave Management

* Casual Leave
* Sick Leave
* Earned Leave
* Optional Holiday
* Comp-off
* Leave balance
* Leave approval
* Multi-level approval
* Leave calendar

