# 2. Modern dashboard

The admin dashboard should immediately show:

```text
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Good Morning, Admin                          │
│                                              │
│ 👥 Employees    🟢 Present    🔴 Absent     │
│    248             221           18          │
│                                              │
│ 🟡 Late          🏖️ On Leave    ⏱️ Overtime │
│     7               2             14         │
│                                              │
├──────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│        Today's Attendance                    │
│                                              │
│     Present     Absent     Late     Leave    │
│       89%        7%        3%       1%       │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

Add graphs for:

* Daily attendance
* Monthly attendance
* Late arrivals
* Absenteeism
* Overtime
* Department-wise attendance

