# 11. Notification system

Support:

```text
📧 Email
📱 Push Notification
💬 WhatsApp/SMS
🔔 In-app notification
```

Examples:

```text
"Your leave has been approved."

"You forgot to check out."

"Your attendance correction was rejected."

"You have worked 9 hours today."
```

---

# 12. Admin roles & permissions ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐

Don't make everyone an admin.

Example:

```text
Super Admin
     ↓
HR Admin
     ↓
Branch Admin
     ↓
Manager
     ↓
Employee
```

Permissions:

```text
View Attendance
Edit Attendance
Approve Leave
Manage Employees
Manage Payroll
View Reports
Manage Settings
```

Use **RBAC — Role-Based Access Control**.

---

# 13. Multi-company / SaaS architecture ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐

If your goal is to **rent this software to different companies**, this is extremely important.

Architecture:

```text
                 Your SaaS
                    │
       ┌────────────┼────────────┐
       ↓            ↓            ↓
   Company A     Company B     Company C
      │             │             │
 Employees       Employees     Employees
 Attendance      Attendance    Attendance
 Payroll         Payroll       Payroll
```

Each company must have completely isolated data.

This is called **multi-tenancy**.

