# 16. Very important: Audit Trail

For HR software, keep track of who changed what.

Example:

```text
Audit Log

User: HR Admin
Action: Updated Attendance
Employee: EMP1024
Old: Absent
New: Present
Date: 31-Aug-2026
Time: 10:32 AM
IP: xxx.xxx.xxx.xxx
```

This becomes extremely useful when there is a dispute.

---

# 17. AI features 🚀

This is where you can differentiate your product from traditional attendance systems.

### AI attendance insights

```text
Attendance Analysis

⚠️ 12 employees have frequent late arrivals.

📈 Monday absenteeism is 18% higher.

⚠️ 5 employees have unusual location patterns.

💡 Department IT has 14% higher overtime
   than the company average.
```

### AI HR assistant

Admin could ask:

> "Who was absent more than 3 days last month?"

And the system returns the result.

Or:

> "Show employees with more than 10 hours overtime this month."

